# CLAUDE.md

Per-repo orientation for `${project_org}/${project_name}` — Packer image
builds for homelab VMs and shared container images.

## Homelab universals

- **Toolchain pinned via `mise.toml`**; task runner `just`.
- **`.env` is a [1Password Developer Environment](https://developer.1password.com/docs/environments/local-env-file)** file. `op run --env-file=.env -- <cmd>`. Never `source .env`.
- **`docz create <type> "Title"`** for new docs.
- **`grep` is `rg`** — drop `-E`.

## Repo layout

```
packer/<image>/
  <name>.pkr.hcl       # template
  variables.pkr.hcl    # input vars
  scripts/             # provisioner scripts
  files/               # files to copy into the image
.env.example
justfile               # `just packer <image>` build wrappers
```

## Conventions

- **One image dir per build target**. Names match the deployment slot
  (`talos`, `debian-trixie`, etc.).
- **Pin Packer version + plugin versions in `versions.pkr.hcl`** and in
  `mise.toml`. Bump together — Renovate watches both.
- **Build via `just packer <name>`** which wraps `packer init && packer
  build` with `op run` for any provider credentials.
- **No shared base images yet** — each build is standalone. Refactor to
  a shared base via Packer's `null` builder + scripts/ inheritance only
  if duplication becomes painful.
- **Container images live with their source repos** (per-app Dockerfiles
  in the app's own repo). This repo's container-image scope is for
  GENERIC, shared images only — e.g. a homelab base-debian with mise
  pre-installed.

## Workflow

- Edit template / scripts.
- `just packer <name>` — runs `packer init`, validates, builds.
- For Proxmox VM template builds, the output uploads to the Proxmox
  template store (creds resolved by `op run`).
- For container builds, push to Harbor (`harbor.fartlab.dev/images/...`)
  via the `.forgejo/workflows/build.yml` on tag push.

